  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/05/P1580099.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Argelita ha vivido este mi&eacute;rcoles la fiesta grande de la Santa Cruz, desde las 9 de la ma&ntilde;ana con la subida al calvario, misa baturra, reparto de pan bendito a la salida, venta de otro tipo de pan bendito en el Ayuntamiento (fotos de la galer&iacute;a de im&aacute;genes), y procesi&oacute;n nocturna.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasantacruzargelita17/p1580086.jpg\" alt=\"p1580086\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasantacruzargelita17/p1580087.jpg\" alt=\"p1580087\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasantacruzargelita17/p1580088.jpg\" alt=\"p1580088\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasantacruzargelita17/p1580089.jpg\" alt=\"p1580089\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasantacruzargelita17/p1580091.jpg\" alt=\"p1580091\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasantacruzargelita17/p1580092.jpg\" alt=\"p1580092\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasantacruzargelita17/p1580094.jpg\" alt=\"p1580094\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasantacruzargelita17/p1580099.jpg\" alt=\"p1580099\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439